  "body": "﻿## What changed\n\n- Added `OpType::Engrave` to `do_not_touch_applies` in `crates/app/src/operation/types/avoid.rs` so the Boundaries panel shows \"Pick protected\" for Engrave operations.\n- Implemented `crates/motion/src/machining2d/trace_avoid.rs` (split from `slots.rs` for the 400-line file rule) so Engrave keeps flutes, shank, and holder clear of protected faces and edges across cutting moves, plunges, retracts, and rapid links.\n- Preserved identical baseline toolpaths when `AvoidSpec` is empty, refused by protected item name when no safe cutting room remains (blocking post), and updated MCP documentation in `crates/app/src/mcp/tools.rs` and `docs/agents/mcp-tools.md`.\n- Added pinning tests in `crates/motion/tests/avoid_engrave.rs`, `crates/app/tests/do_not_touch_engrave.rs`, and `crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/do_not_touch.rs`, and recorded design choices in `docs/decisions/3349-engrave-do-not-touch.md`.\n\n## Verification\n\n- Pinning tests (`head` `db8e12b4b3fc98d6ac8f5f3469e4d2265bba7258`):\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-motion --lib --test avoid_engrave`: `lib` 536 passed, 0 failed, 10 ignored; `avoid_engrave` 4 passed, 0 failed.\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-app --lib` plus `engrave|do_not_touch|mcp|verify` suites: `lib` 297 passed, `do_not_touch` 3 passed, `do_not_touch_engrave` 3 passed, `do_not_touch_project` 3 passed, `engrave_law` 10 passed, `mcp_doc_drift` 6 passed, `mcp` 23 passed, `verify` 21 passed (2 ignored), and all remaining matched MCP/verify suites passed with 0 failures.\n  - `cargo test -j 10 -p camcraft-ui --lib -- --test-threads=1`: `1428 passed, 0 failed, 7 ignored` (single-threaded per Windows #3379), including all 4 `egui_app::tests::do_not_touch::*` tests.\n- `cargo clippy -j 10 -p camcraft-motion -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: passed (exit 0).\n- `cargo test -j 10 --release -p camcraft-motion --test avoid_engrave -- --ignored` and `cargo test -j 10 --release -p camcraft-app --test do_not_touch --test do_not_touch_engrave -- --ignored`: 0 failed (all non-ignored).\n- Trial merge against `upstream/main` (`43217a7c4`): clean (`git merge-tree --write-tree` exit 0).\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- Remaining `motion heavy` and `app heavy` lanes (243 steps in `cargo xtask gate heavy --dry-run`): not run - owed to the wave run before merge (#3467).\n- Full `cargo xtask gate batch` across unrelated `camcraft-app` / `camcraft-ui` integration binaries.\n\nfork synced at v0.25.0\nChangelog: Engrave operations support \"Do not touch\" protection across cuts, plunges, retracts and rapid links, and refuse blocked cuts by item name.\nEffort: high\n\nFixes #3349\r\n",
